{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"10150","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10150","key":"MC-379","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"25/Oct/12 12:55 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Setting <b>spawn-npcs=false</b> in server.properties disables villagers completely<br>\nSetting <b>spawn-animals=false</b> prevents any mob from being spawned by commands or mob spawners.</p>\n\n<p><b>What I expected to happen was...</b><br>\nVillagers and animals to stop naturally spawning.<br>\nMobs to still be allowed to be summoned via commands</p>\n\n<p><b>What actually happened was...</b><br>\n<b>ALL</b> Villagers, including pre-existing ones in the world, or ones newly placed via spawn eggs, disappear instantly.</p>\n\n<p><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b></p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Run a server</li>\n\t<li>Change server.properties to:\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">spawn-npcs=<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\nspawn-animals=<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\nspawn-monsters=<span class=\"code-keyword\">false</span>\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Join the server and execute the following commands\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/summon villager\n/summon wolf\n/summon zombie\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>With difficulty on non-peaceful, you can see the Zombie summons fine.  But the Villager and Wolf do not stay in the world.<br>\nFor custom maps, commands should override any server.properties as it does with hostile mobs.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"04/Apr/20 10:44 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[],"versions":null,"resolutiondate":"14/Aug/24 4:38 AM","issuelinks":null,"updated":"20/Aug/26 1:22 AM","status":null},"fields":{"summary":"spawn-animals and spawn-npcs=false removes all villagers and prevents summoning new mobs","issuetype":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"A problem which impairs or prevents the functions of the product. (Migrated on 23 Jan 2025 19:08 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium","name":"Bug","subtask":false,"avatarId":10303,"hierarchyLevel":0},"watches":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/MC-379/watchers","watchCount":1,"isWatching":false},"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":null,"created":"2012-10-25T00:55:35.504-0700","customfield_10050":null,"customfield_10051":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10098","value":"Platform","id":"10098"},"description":{"type":"doc","version":1,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Setting "},{"type":"text","text":"spawn-npcs=false","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" in server.properties disables villagers completely"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Setting "},{"type":"text","text":"spawn-animals=false","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" prevents any mob from being spawned by commands or mob spawners."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What I expected to happen was...","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Villagers and animals to stop naturally spawning."},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Mobs to still be allowed to be summoned via commands"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"What actually happened was...","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"ALL","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":" Villagers, including pre-existing ones in the world, or ones newly placed via spawn eggs, disappear instantly."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Steps to Reproduce:","marks":[{"type":"strong"}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"order":1},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Run a server"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Change server.properties to:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"spawn-npcs=false\nspawn-animals=false\nspawn-monsters=false"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Join the server and execute the following commands"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"java"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"/summon villager\n/summon wolf\n/summon zombie"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"With difficulty on non-peaceful, you can see the Zombie summons fine.  But the Villager and Wolf do not stay in the world."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"For custom maps, commands should override any server.properties as it does with hostile mobs."}]}]},"customfield_10054":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10023","value":"Confirmed","id":"10023"},"fixVersions":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/version/12132","id":"12132","description":"","name":"24w33a","archived":true,"released":true}],"customfield_10055":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/customFieldOption/10066","value":"Mob spawning","id":"10066"}],"resolution":{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/resolution/10004","id":"10004","description":"A fix for this issue is checked into the tree and tested.","name":"Fixed"},"customfield_10047":"2020-04-04T22:44:00.000-0700","customfield_10048":null,"labels":["npc","